===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|úlfr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*wulfaz}}, from {{inh|is|ine-pro|*wĺ̥kʷos}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈulvʏr/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ulvʏr|lang=is}}
*: {{homophones|Úlfur|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|úlfs|úlfar}}

# a [[wolf]]
# [[parhelion]], [[sun dog]]
# [[Lupus]]

====Usage notes====
Refers to a parhelion seen to the east (i.e. viewer’s left) of the sun, and is described as following the sun. The term {{m|is|gíll}} is used for the parhelion on the other side (“ahead of” the sun).

